---
/**
 * KotlinMocksSection.astro
 * Nexa Design Lab · Canonical Android Jetpack Compose M3 Specifications (100% Kotlin Nativo)
 *
 * MOCKS SEPARADOS POR ROLES OPERATIVOS & CON ARTEFACTOS CANÓNICOS RESPETADOS:
 *
 * ROL 1: CONDUCTOR EN RUTA (Diego Morales · Flota C-250 · WKN-892)
 *   1.1 Despacho en Ruta & Telemetría Sensirion 2°C–6°C (MOB-US-026..028, 031)
 *   1.2 Proof of Delivery (POD) & Firma Digital del Receptor (MOB-US-033, 034)
 *   1.3 Cobro Contra Entrega (COD) & Vuelto en Efectivo (MOB-US-066..069)
 *   1.4 Reporte de Siniestros & Evidencia CameraX con GPS (MOB-US-056..058)
 *   1.5 Devoluciones RMA & Logística Inversa (MOB-US-070, 071)
 *
 * ROL 2: OPERADOR DE ALMACÉN FRIGORÍFICO (Alejandro Vargas · Planta Callao)
 *   2.1 Picking FEFO con Lote Prioritario L-20260914-A (MOB-US-011..016, 051)
 *   2.2 Escáner CameraX / GS1 con Retícula Láser & Fallback Manual (MOB-US-011, ADR-0018)
 *   2.3 Inspección ISO 3691 & Bloqueo de Ignición Lockout (MOB-US-073)
 *   2.4 Conteo Cíclico e Inventario Ciego sin Sesgo (MOB-US-061..065)
 *   2.5 Resiliencia Offline SQLite / Room en Cámara Frigorífica (MOB-US-041..043)
 *
 * ROL 3: COORDINADORA DE DESPACHO (Mariela · Muelle 3 Frío)
 *   3.1 Tablero de Muelle 3 Frío, Estiba de Pallets & Precinto #NX-9921 (MOB-US-020..025)
 *
 * ROL 4: COMPRADOR MAYORISTA B2B (Carlos Mendoza · Restaurantes del Mar)
 *   4.1 Catálogo B2B Mayorista con Precios Escalonados por Volumen (MOB-US-036..039)
 *   4.2 Recepción Comprador & Código Handoff OTP NX-8842 (MOB-US-047..049)
 *
 * ROL 5: SEGURIDAD & SESIÓN TRANSVERSAL (Mobile User)
 *   5.1 Biometría BiometricPrompt & Selección de Sede Logística (MOB-US-001..003)
 *
 * ARTEFACTOS RESPETADOS 1:1:
 *  - TopAppBar: 52dp canónica con drawer/back, título de pantalla, identificador de unidad y acciones contextuales.
 *  - BottomNav: 58dp persistente con indicador píldora (#dbeafe / #1d4ed8) de 5 destinos canónicos por rol (con botón Inicio en la extrema izquierda) y barra de gestos Android nativa.
 *  - Visor Escáner: Retícula de 4 esquinas, rayo láser animado y fallback manual asistido (ADR-0018).
 *  - ZERO GREEN: Semántica de éxito estrictamente Cyan/Azul (#0284c7, #e0f2fe, #bae6fd).
 */
---

<div class="kotlin-mocks-container">

  <!-- Showcase Header -->
  <header class="showcase-header">
    <div class="header-content">
      <span class="section-kicker-badge">
        <i class="pi pi-android" aria-hidden="true"></i> ANDROID JETPACK COMPOSE M3 NATIVO (:core:designsystem)
      </span>
      <h2 class="showcase-title">Mocks Canónicos Separados por Roles Operativos</h2>
      <p class="showcase-intro">
        Navegación 1:1 estructurada por <strong>Roles de Usuario</strong> (Conductor, Almacén, Despacho, Comprador y Transversal), respetando con absoluta fidelidad los <strong>artefactos canónicos</strong> (M3 TopAppBar canónica, BottomNavigationBar de 5 destinos con botón Inicio en la extrema izquierda, barra de gestos Android y Visor CameraX con fallback manual).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- PRIMARY ROLE SELECTOR TABS -->
    <div class="roles-selector-container">
      <span class="roles-kicker-label">SELECCIONAR ROL OPERATIVO:</span>
      <div class="roles-tabs-bar" role="tablist" aria-label="Roles de Usuario Nexa">
        <button type="button" class="role-pill-btn active" data-role="all">
          <i class="pi pi-th-large"></i> Todos los Roles <span class="role-count-pill">14</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="role-pill-btn" data-role="driver">
          <i class="pi pi-truck"></i> Conductor en Ruta (Diego Morales) <span class="role-count-pill">5</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="role-pill-btn" data-role="warehouse">
          <i class="pi pi-box"></i> Operador Almacén (Alejandro Vargas) <span class="role-count-pill">5</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="role-pill-btn" data-role="dispatch">
          <i class="pi pi-send"></i> Coordinación Despacho (Mariela) <span class="role-count-pill">1</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="role-pill-btn" data-role="buyer">
          <i class="pi pi-shopping-bag"></i> Comprador B2B (Carlos Mendoza) <span class="role-count-pill">2</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="role-pill-btn" data-role="auth">
          <i class="pi pi-lock"></i> Seguridad & Sesión (Mobile User) <span class="role-count-pill">1</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SECONDARY SCREEN SELECTOR PILLS -->
    <div class="screens-selector-wrapper">
      <div class="screens-pills-bar" role="tablist" aria-label="Pantallas Filtradas">
        <!-- Driver Screens -->
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn active" data-target="mock-screen-route" data-role="driver">
          <span class="screen-idx">1.1</span> <i class="pi pi-map-marker"></i> En Ruta & Telemetría
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-pod" data-role="driver">
          <span class="screen-idx">1.2</span> <i class="pi pi-check-circle"></i> Entrega POD & Firma
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-cod" data-role="driver">
          <span class="screen-idx">1.3</span> <i class="pi pi-dollar"></i> Cobro COD & Vuelto
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-incident" data-role="driver">
          <span class="screen-idx">1.4</span> <i class="pi pi-exclamation-triangle"></i> Siniestros & GPS
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-rma" data-role="driver">
          <span class="screen-idx">1.5</span> <i class="pi pi-undo"></i> Devoluciones RMA
        </button>

        <!-- Warehouse Screens -->
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-picking" data-role="warehouse">
          <span class="screen-idx">2.1</span> <i class="pi pi-box"></i> Picking FEFO
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-scanner" data-role="warehouse">
          <span class="screen-idx">2.2</span> <i class="pi pi-qrcode"></i> Escáner GS1 / CameraX
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-inspection" data-role="warehouse">
          <span class="screen-idx">2.3</span> <i class="pi pi-shield"></i> Inspección ISO 3691
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-cycle" data-role="warehouse">
          <span class="screen-idx">2.4</span> <i class="pi pi-table"></i> Conteo Cíclico Ciego
        </button>

        <!-- Dispatch Screen -->
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-dispatch" data-role="dispatch">
          <span class="screen-idx">3.1</span> <i class="pi pi-send"></i> Muelle 3 & Precinto
        </button>

        <!-- Buyer Screens -->
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-catalog" data-role="buyer">
          <span class="screen-idx">4.1</span> <i class="pi pi-shopping-bag"></i> Catálogo Tier Pricing
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-receipt" data-role="buyer">
          <span class="screen-idx">4.2</span> <i class="pi pi-check-circle"></i> Recepción OTP Handoff
        </button>

        <!-- Transversal Screens -->
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-sync" data-role="warehouse">
          <span class="screen-idx">2.5</span> <i class="pi pi-sync"></i> Resiliencia Offline
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="screen-tab-btn" data-target="mock-screen-auth" data-role="auth">
          <span class="screen-idx">5.1</span> <i class="pi pi-lock"></i> Biometría & Sede
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- MOCKS STAGE LAYOUT -->
  <div class="mocks-stage-layout">

    <!-- =========================================================================
         SCREEN 1.1: DRIVER EN RUTA & TELEMETRÍA (MOB-US-026..028, 031)
         Samsung Galaxy S24 / Pixel 8 (390×844dp) · Diego Morales
         ========================================================================= -->
    <div class="mock-screen-card active" id="mock-screen-route" data-role="driver">
      <div class="device-meta-header">
        <div class="meta-title-col">
          <span class="device-eyebrow">ROL 1: CONDUCTOR · PANTALLA 1.1 (390×844dp)</span>
          <h3 class="device-name">Despacho en Ruta & Telemetría Sensirion 2°C–6°C</h3>
          <p class="device-sub">Diego Morales · Flota C-250 · Placa WKN-892 · Pedido SO-2026-0018 (ICISA Distribuciones)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-pills">
          <span class="meta-pill role"><i class="pi pi-truck"></i> Conductor en Ruta</span>
          <span class="meta-pill touch"><i class="pi pi-check"></i> 48dp OK</span>
          <span class="meta-pill gold"><i class="pi pi-star-fill"></i> Gold Standard</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mock-split-viewer">
        <div class="android-chassis phone-s24">
          <div class="chassis-speaker-slit"></div>
          <div class="chassis-punch-hole"></div>

          <div class="android-screen-surface">
            <!-- Android System Bar -->
            <div class="m3-system-bar">
              <span class="sys-time">14:35</span>
              <div class="sys-icons">
                <span class="sys-tech">5G LTE</span>
                <i class="pi pi-wifi"></i>
                <i class="pi pi-bolt"></i>
                <span class="sys-battery">94%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- M3 TopAppBar (Image 4 exact) -->
            <header class="m3-top-bar">
              <button type="button" class="top-bar-btn" aria-label="Menú">
                <i class="pi pi-bars"></i>
              </button>
              <h4 class="top-bar-title">Operaciones Nexa</h4>
              <button type="button" class="top-bar-btn notif" aria-label="Notificaciones">
                <i class="pi pi-bell"></i>
                <span class="notif-red-dot"></span>
              </button>
            </header>

            <!-- Screen Body -->
            <div class="screen-scroll-body">
              <!-- Driver Identification Card -->
              <div class="driver-card-white">
                <div class="driver-avatar-circle"><i class="pi pi-user"></i></div>
                <div class="driver-info-block">
                  <div class="driver-name-row">
                    <strong class="driver-name">Diego Morales</strong>
                    <span class="status-pill-cyan" id="route-driver-status">● EN RUTA</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="driver-detail-text">Conductor Flota C-250 · ID #4829</span>
                  <span class="driver-detail-sub">Furgón Refrigerado · Placa WKN-892</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Cold Chain Header & Calibrator -->
              <div class="section-label-row">
                <span class="screen-section-label">DESPACHO EN CURSO · CADENA DE FRÍO</span>
                <div class="temp-stepper-box">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-stepper-micro" id="btn-temp-minus">−0.2°</button>
                  <span class="cold-chip-pill live" id="route-temp-badge">
                    <i class="pi pi-snowflake"></i> <strong id="route-temp-val">3.8°C</strong> (2°-6°C)
                  </span>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-stepper-micro" id="btn-temp-plus">+0.2°</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Dispatch Card -->
              <div class="dispatch-card-white">
                <div class="dispatch-card-top">
                  <span class="order-code-mono">SO-2026-0018</span>
                  <span class="cold-chip-pill"><i class="pi pi-box"></i> 36 bultos</span>
                </div>

                <div class="dispatch-buyer-info">
                  <h5 class="buyer-company-name">ICISA Distribuciones S.A.C.</h5>
                  <p class="buyer-cargo-desc">24x Salmón Salar (ALM-LMO-982) + 12x Merluza Austral</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Route Timeline -->
                <div class="route-timeline-box">
                  <div class="timeline-stop">
                    <span class="timeline-dot blue"></span>
                    <div class="timeline-stop-text">
                      <strong class="stop-name">Salida CD Frigorífico Callao</strong>
                      <span class="stop-time">Salida Muelle 3 Frío · 13:45</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="timeline-vertical-line"></div>
                  <div class="timeline-stop">
                    <span class="timeline-dot blue"></span>
                    <div class="timeline-stop-text">
                      <strong class="stop-name">Peaje Ancón Km 48</strong>
                      <span class="stop-time">Control Frío Validado · 14:10</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="timeline-vertical-line"></div>
                  <div class="timeline-stop" id="tl-stop-dest">
                    <span class="timeline-dot cyan" id="tl-dot-dest"></span>
                    <div class="timeline-stop-text">
                      <strong class="stop-name" id="tl-dest-title">Destino: ICISA Distribuciones</strong>
                      <span class="stop-time" id="tl-dest-time">ETA 14:20 · Av. Argentina 1240</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Geofence 200m Simulator Action -->
                <button type="button" class="btn-action-outline-pill" id="btn-toggle-arrival">
                  <i class="pi pi-map-marker"></i>
                  <span id="lbl-arrival">Simular Llegada al Destino (Geocerca 200m)</span>
                </button>

                <!-- Full Width CTA Button -->
                <button type="button" class="btn-solid-blue-cta" id="btn-goto-pod">
                  <i class="pi pi-check-circle"></i>
                  <span>Proceder a Entrega & POD (Pantalla 1.2)</span>
                </button>
              </div>

              <!-- Quick Telemetry Card -->
              <div class="quick-telemetry-card">
                <div class="telemetry-item">
                  <span class="tel-label">Temperatura Caja</span>
                  <strong class="tel-val success" id="quick-tel-temp"><i class="pi pi-check-circle"></i> 3.8°C</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="telemetry-separator"></div>
                <div class="telemetry-item">
                  <span class="tel-label">Batería Termógrafo</span>
                  <strong class="tel-val">88% (Sensirion)</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar (Canonical 5-destination with Inicio & Gestures) -->
            <nav class="m3-bottom-nav" aria-label="Navegación Móvil Principal">
              <div class="bnav-item active" data-nav-target="mock-screen-route">
                <div class="bnav-pill-indicator"><i class="pi pi-home"></i></div>
                <span class="bnav-label">Inicio</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bnav-item" data-nav-target="mock-screen-route">
                <div class="bnav-pill-indicator"><i class="pi pi-map-marker"></i></div>
                <span class="bnav-label">Rutas</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bnav-item" data-nav-target="mock-screen-pod">
                <div class="bnav-pill-indicator"><i class="pi pi-send"></i></div>
                <span class="bnav-label">Despacho</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bnav-item" data-nav-target="mock-screen-picking">
                <div class="bnav-pill-indicator"><i class="pi pi-box"></i></div>
                <span class="bnav-label">Picking</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bnav-item" data-nav-target="mock-screen-incident">
                <div class="bnav-pill-indicator"><i class="pi pi-check-square"></i></div>
                <span class="bnav-label">Checklist</span>
              </div>
            </nav>

            <!-- Android Home Gesture Bar -->
            <div class="android-gesture-pill-bar" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="gesture-handle"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Spec / Code Side Column -->
        <div class="spec-side-col">
          <div class="story-traceability-card">
            <div class="trace-header">
              <span class="trace-tag epic">MOBILE-EPIC-04</span>
              <span class="trace-tag story">MOB-US-026 · MOB-US-027 · MOB-US-028</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="trace-title">MOB-US-026 / 028 — Ver Entregas Asignadas & Navegación Autorizada</h4>
            <p class="trace-persona"><strong>Actor Funcional:</strong> Diego Morales (Driver / Delivery Operator)</p>
            <div class="trace-gherkin">
              <div class="scenario-item"><span class="kw-given">GIVEN</span> Conductor autorizado en furgón WKN-892</div>
              <div class="scenario-item"><span class="kw-when">WHEN</span> Abre navegación autorizada hacia el destino de entrega</div>
              <div class="scenario-item"><span class="kw-then">THEN</span> Registra un único Delivery Attempt activo y monitorea temperatura de 2°C a 6°C</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="code-editor-box">
            <div class="editor-header">
              <span class="file-name"><i class="pi pi-file-code"></i> MockMobileScreens.kt · MockDriverRouteScreen</span>
              <span class="target-tag">Jetpack Compose M3 Nativo</span>
            </div>
            <pre><code><span class="kw">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">MockDriverRouteScreen</span>(
    onConfirmDelivery: () -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span> = &#123;&#125;,
    onScanHandoff: () -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span> = &#123;&#125;,
    modifier: <span class="type">Modifier</span> = Modifier
) &#123;
    <span class="kw">var</span> hasArrived <span class="kw">by</span> remember &#123; mutableStateOf(<span class="kw">false</span>) &#125;
    <span class="kw">var</span> currentTemp <span class="kw">by</span> remember &#123; mutableFloatStateOf(<span class="num">3.8f</span>) &#125;

    <span class="type">Column</span>(
        modifier = modifier.fillMaxSize().background(NexaColors.Canvas).padding(<span class="num">16</span>.dp),
        verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(<span class="num">16</span>.dp)
    ) &#123;
        <span class="fn">NexaDriverProfileCard</span>(
            driverName = <span class="str">"Diego Morales"</span>,
            roleTitle = <span class="str">"Conductor Flota C-250 · ID #4829"</span>,
            vehicleInfo = <span class="str">"Furgón Refrigerado · Placa WKN-892"</span>,
            statusText = <span class="kw">if</span> (hasArrived) <span class="str">"● EN DESTINO"</span> <span class="kw">else</span> <span class="str">"● EN RUTA"</span>
        )
        <span class="fn">NexaColdChainBadge</span>(temperatureRange = String.format(<span class="str">"%.1f°C (2°-6°C)"</span>, currentTemp))
        <span class="fn">NexaPrimaryButton</span>(label = <span class="str">"Proceder a Entrega &amp; POD"</span>, onClick = onConfirmDelivery)
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- =========================================================================
         SCREEN 1.2: PROOF OF DELIVERY (POD) & FIRMA DIGITAL (MOB-US-033, 034)
         Samsung Galaxy S24 (390×844dp) · Diego Morales
         ========================================================================= -->
    <div class="mock-screen-card" id="mock-screen-pod" data-role="driver">
      <div class="device-meta-header">
        <div class="meta-title-col">
          <span class="device-eyebrow">ROL 1: CONDUCTOR · PANTALLA 1.2 (390×844dp)</span>
          <h3 class="device-name">Proof of Delivery (POD) & Firma Digital del Receptor</h3>
          <p class="device-sub">Diego Morales · ICISA Distribuciones · Captura de Firma, Fotos de Remito & Timestamp</p>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-pills">
          <span class="meta-pill role"><i class="pi pi-pencil"></i> Firma Digital POD</span>
          <span class="meta-pill touch"><i class="pi pi-camera"></i> 2 Fotos Adjuntas</span>
          <span class="meta-pill feature"><i class="pi pi-shield"></i> SHA-256</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mock-split-viewer">
        <div class="android-chassis phone-s24">
          <div class="chassis-speaker-slit"></div>
          <div class="chassis-punch-hole"></div>

          <div class="android-screen-surface">
            <div class="m3-system-bar">
              <span class="sys-time">14:38</span>
              <div class="sys-icons"><span class="sys-tech">5G</span><i class="pi pi-wifi"></i><span class="sys-battery">93%</span></div>
            </div>

            <!-- M3 TopAppBar -->
            <header class="m3-top-bar">
              <button type="button" class="top-bar-btn" aria-label="Volver"><i class="pi pi-arrow-left"></i></button>
              <h4 class="top-bar-title">Registro POD & Firma</h4>
              <button type="button" class="top-bar-btn notif" aria-label="Notificaciones"><i class="pi pi-bell"></i><span class="notif-red-dot"></span></button>
            </header>

            <div class="screen-scroll-body">
              <div class="dispatch-card-white">
                <div class="dispatch-card-top">
                  <span class="order-code-mono">POD-2026-0018</span>
                  <span class="status-pill-cyan">EN REVELACIÓN</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dispatch-buyer-info">
                  <h5 class="buyer-company-name">Receptor: Lic. Mario Casas</h5>
                  <p class="buyer-cargo-desc">DNI 10.482.912 · Encargado de Recepción Frío</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Digital Signature Canvas Preview -->
                <div class="signature-canvas-box">
                  <svg class="sig-svg" viewBox="0 0 320 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M 20 50 Q 50 15, 75 40 T 130 35 Q 160 10, 180 55 T 230 45 Q 260 20, 290 40" fill="none" stroke="#082846" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                    <path d="M 60 48 Q 110 58, 220 50" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    <circle cx="280" cy="38" r="2.5" fill="#0284c7" />
                  </svg>
                  <div class="sig-watermark-row">
                    <span>Timestamp: 2026-09-29 14:38:22 COT</span>
                    <span class="sig-hash">SHA-256: e82f...a19c</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Photo Evidence Counter -->
                <div class="pod-signature-row">
                  <div class="toggle-text-block">
                    <strong class="toggle-title">Fotos de Remito Físico & Mercadería</strong>
                    <span class="toggle-sub">2 imágenes adjuntadas con GPS</span>
                  </div>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-badge-action" id="btn-pod-add-photo">
                    <i class="pi pi-camera"></i> <span id="lbl-pod-photo-text">2 Fotos</span>
                  </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Confirm POD Button -->
                <button type="button" class="btn-solid-blue-cta" id="btn-finalize-pod-screen">
                  <i class="pi pi-check-circle"></i>
                  <span id="lbl-pod-screen-btn">Completar POD & Cerrar Entrega</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar (Canonical 5-destination with Inicio & Gestures) -->
            <nav class="m3-bottom-nav" aria-label="Navegación Móvil Principal">
              <div class="bnav-item" data-nav-target="mock-screen-route">
                <div class="bnav-pill-indicator"><i class="pi pi-home"></i></div>
